    "detailed_description": "<h1>Playtest soon</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/66ad06520d537570cc3d6b1e97d66e35.avif?t=1754483799\" /></span>Bring a katana to a gunfight and raise hell on your next coffee break.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to DESPA</strong> \u2014 a brutal, neon-lit arena shooter built for after-work warriors who\u2019ve got more stress than free time. No bullshit. No downtime. Just steel, speed, and vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/a8cb7398410f2882ff1542440b4f1529.avif?t=1754483799\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/9d105bf9b05dd9e1125df555f39df81b.poster.avif?t=1754483799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/9d105bf9b05dd9e1125df555f39df81b.webm?t=1754483799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instant matchmaking, 7-minute rounds. Blink and you're dead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fair aim-assist: controller or mouse, skill wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >140-tick servers. Lag? Not here.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/9355226c8f997fee559387b0a438126a.avif?t=1754483799\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/43ddff6351ef7c363eb6407a5b12504d.poster.avif?t=1754483799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/43ddff6351ef7c363eb6407a5b12504d.webm?t=1754483799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, wall-run, grapple. If you\u2019re not moving, you\u2019re losing.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the arena. It doesn\u2019t care who you are, just how you kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/38e3989ee5f2d5d625c595636f2ee68b.avif?t=1754483799\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/85dd9acdcf5f56201c82d6eae430a1d8.poster.avif?t=1754483799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/85dd9acdcf5f56201c82d6eae430a1d8.webm?t=1754483799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart spawns put you behind the bastard who killed you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mercy. No rules. No humanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/8be85c18b2474f9d4b60f0b04b4fb50c.avif?t=1754483799\" /></span><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/40303f254f02c26aafdb395c6b59c051.poster.avif?t=1754483799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/40303f254f02c26aafdb395c6b59c051.webm?t=1754483799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kill counts: earn medals that unlock badass skins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15-minute daily quests. Done by your second espresso.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No pay-to-win. Ever. Just gear that looks lethal.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/921dcae8e3a921026918818cced899e6.avif?t=1754483799\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/5aede9ac1ce6223eee6b6fe26bfb4e79.poster.avif?t=1754483799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2259240/extras/5aede9ac1ce6223eee6b6fe26bfb4e79.webm?t=1754483799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old-school heart. 2026 muscle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot is earned. Every frag is personal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speed. Designed for chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If your PC survived DOOM 2016, you're ready.</strong> Are you?</p>",
